<title>SWITZERLAND: ALPINE SKIING-ZELANSKAJA WINS WOMEN'S WORLD CUP DOWNHILL.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-ZELANSKAJA WINS WOMEN'S WORLD CUP DOWNHILL.</headline>
<dateline>LAAX, Switzerland 1997-02-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian Warwara Zelenskaja won a women's World Cup downhill on Saturday in a time of one minute 24.98 seconds, according to provisional results.  </p>
<p>Heidi Zurbriggen of Switzerland and Austrian Renate Goetschl finished joint second in 1:25.07.</p>
</text>
